{"ID":"20240513083034-1mayv18","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083034-1mayv18","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083034-1mayv18\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170249-27jsk84\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170249-27jsk84\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513170249-27jsk84\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:623,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:623\u0026#125;","title":"272","type":"doc","updated":"20240514171037"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513170249-27jsk84","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 916px;","id":"20240513170249-27jsk84","updated":"20240514171037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"209-2 L,X"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008-05-20"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1． 後腦梢至肛門一直很緊"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2． 大便秘，小腹一直覺得很冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3． 不易出汗，右腿很怕冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡：不好， 因後腦梢至肛門一直很緊，及右腿很怕冷以至無法睡覺"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便：始終便秘。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 汗：不易出汗，只有喝很熱的湯才會出汗， 流汗時，便秘情況稍有緩解"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 尿：黃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 胃口：好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 口渴：無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 身體：不怕冷，腿非常怕冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 常有股虛熱往上沖，當此虛火往上沖時就很容易著涼"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈大"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃濕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太陽溫病"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前方採先攻理，裏證已去很多，下焦溫度已回。此次表證重裏證仍有，我們重點採解表兼攻裏"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛根6錢， 麻黃3錢，桂枝4錢， 白芍4錢， 炙甘草2錢，生薑 2片， 大棗10枚 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"項強， 葛根湯證"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槴子3錢， 黃芩2錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 清虛熱和燥濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黃3錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻裏實"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2付 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大火煮 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6→ 2 bf b/s"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.後腦梢到尾椎，神經繃很緊感，項強表證，便秘為裏證，故表裏證皆有，服上次方後裏證已去了很多，但仍然有裏證，重點解表兼攻裏"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.發表前一定要問口渴，如果沒有口渴就可以解表，解表時沒口渴炙甘草加少一點，因炙甘草會蓄水，有口渴炙甘草多加一些。3． 解表時肺陽打開，體內的壓力與大氣壓力一樣，大氣壓力進入大腸大便就比較容易排出來"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、表裏皆有時，採攻裏時，不可大下，否則表邪會入裏，病人會產生胸脅苦滿。發汗時要避風吹"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 解表藥要用大火煮"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}